WEBVTT

00:00:39.229 --> 00:00:44.001
TODAY IS JA- JULY EIGHTH, NINETEEN NINETY-SIX.

00:00:44.001 --> 00:00:47.137
THE INTERVIEWEE IS Moyshe Gorelik.

00:00:47.245 --> 00:00:50.203
THE INTERVIEWER IS ANN LAMET.

00:00:50.203 --> 00:00:52.470
THE LANGUAGE IS YIDDISH.

00:00:52.611 --> 00:00:56.621
IN THE CITY OF MIAMI BEACH. THE STATE IS FLORIDA.

00:01:00.154 --> 00:01:04.660
TODAY IS JULY EIGHTH, NINETEEN NINETY-SIX.

00:01:04.693 --> 00:01:07.893
THE INTERVIEWEE IS Moyshe Gorelik.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:10.897
THE INTERVIEWER IS ANN LAMET.

00:01:10.954 --> 00:01:16.027
THE LANGUAGE IS YIDDISH. IN THE CITY OF MIAMI BEACH, THE STATE OF FLORIDA.

00:01:20.927 --> 00:01:23.098
kenst zogn, vos iz dayn nomen?

00:01:26.192 --> 00:01:27.927
ikh bin Moyshe

00:01:27.927 --> 00:01:31.738
Berl's. mayn familye iz Gorelik.

00:01:32.284 --> 00:01:34.117
un fun vu kumstu?

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:39.440
un ikh bin, ikh bin, geven geborn in toyznt nayn hundert I tsvantsik eyntn yor,

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.808
UNK fertsnte AUGUST,

00:01:43.287 --> 00:01:44.327
vu?

00:01:43.422 --> 00:01:45.670
in a shtetele Paritsh.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.629
Paritsh, dos iz in Belarusye.

00:01:49.632 --> 00:01:51.870
di shtetele iz geven

00:01:52.348 --> 00:01:54.873
dortn o, avu s'iz,

00:01:55.318 --> 00:01:58.282
s'iz geven farlorn in velder

00:01:58.558 --> 00:02:00.090
un felder.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:03.007
zi iz geven tif in Belarusye.

00:02:03.553 --> 00:02:07.816
iz beys s'hot getrofn di ⟨begole⟩, es iz oyf undz ongefaln

00:02:08.092 --> 00:02:09.621
der bandit,

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:12.677
iz keyner nit gekent antloyfn,

00:02:12.784 --> 00:02:15.852
vayle s'iz nit geven keyn vegn

00:02:15.852 --> 00:02:17.789
vu me ken gikh

00:02:18.741 --> 00:02:20.687
antloyfn funem gazlen.

00:02:20.687 --> 00:02:23.814
dos iz durkhgegangen geven oyfn dritn tog.

00:02:24.681 --> 00:02:26.210
oyfn dritn tog

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.344
iz er shoyn geven in shtetele Paritsh.

00:02:29.344 --> 00:02:32.049
vos iz dos far a shtetele Paritsh?

00:02:32.815 --> 00:02:35.644
darf zogn, vos iz di nomen fun dayn mame

00:02:35.228 --> 00:02:36.639
ye. ⟨i-⟩...

00:02:35.785 --> 00:02:38.529
un di nomen fun dayn tate?

00:02:37.388 --> 00:02:38.614
ye.

00:02:38.687 --> 00:02:46.505
in, in shtetele Paritsh iz geven, dos iz geven undzer geburtst-familye.

00:02:46.505 --> 00:02:48.708
dortn ⟨o⟩ iz hot zikh gehat

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:50.561
mayn mame,

00:02:50.787 --> 00:02:52.386
mayn tate,

00:02:52.386 --> 00:02:56.816
nu, un mir, ale brider un shvester, mayne mumes,

00:02:56.816 --> 00:02:59.589
ale hobn gelebt in der shtetele.

00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:04.297
di shtetele dan iz geven azoy vi ale yidishe shtetlekh.

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:14.510
arum nit vayt iz geven andere shtetlekh vi Petshishtshe, Shatilkes, Kovshits, Shtshedrin.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.645
 ot dos alts iz geven arum,

00:03:18.327 --> 00:03:25.890
un, mir hobn dortn o gevoksn, mir di kinder, biz vanen

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:30.200
me hot geendikt di shul, flegn mir avekforn in andere shtet

00:03:30.207 --> 00:03:35.415
kedey, PRODOL-, forshteln undzer lernen zikh vayter.

00:03:36.012 --> 00:03:39.938
kenst zogn di nomen fun dayn mame un di nomen fun...?

00:03:38.712 --> 00:03:41.760
mayn mame hot geheysn Khaye Sore.

00:03:43.032 --> 00:03:46.142
ir meydlshe familye heyst Kuznetsove.

00:03:46.142 --> 00:03:48.639
az zi hot khasene gehat, hot zi genumen

00:03:48.639 --> 00:03:50.512
dem, di familye,

00:03:50.512 --> 00:03:53.369
di FAMILY fun mayn tatn, Gorelik.

00:03:53.595 --> 00:03:55.242
mayn tate — Berl.

00:03:56.143 --> 00:03:57.909
Dovid iz geven

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.017
zayn tate, heyst dos Berl Dovid's.

00:04:01.017 --> 00:04:03.022
azoy hot men dan geredt

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:06.532
tsu yedern: Berl ben Dovid's.

00:04:06.792 --> 00:04:10.650
nu, f- di f- FAMILY Gorelik. ot azoy

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.324
zaynen mir geven in der shtetele Paritsh. mir zaynen geven zeks

00:04:15.499 --> 00:04:17.749
kinder bay di eltern.

00:04:17.749 --> 00:04:21.601
bay mir iz geven tsvey bobes mit a zeydn

00:04:21.996 --> 00:04:26.630
far der milkhome, velkhe ikh hob, ikh gedenk bay hayntikn tog ⟨nokh⟩ zey.

00:04:27.092 --> 00:04:30.126
un es iz... nu, un mayne,

00:04:30.126 --> 00:04:32.790
ikh ken zikh nit dermonen,

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.865
ikh hob shoyn fargesn nebekh

00:04:35.293 --> 00:04:37.278
eynike gezikhtn

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.700
fun mayne kroyvim,

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:43.850
afile fun, dem klenern briderl,

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.775
velkhe di gazlonim hobn fargrobn lebedikerheyt.

00:04:48.675 --> 00:04:52.736
ikh gedenk shoyn UNK s'iz durkh fuftsik finf yor

00:04:53.046 --> 00:04:56.139
nokh der milkhome, un zint kh'hob zey gezen,

00:04:56.139 --> 00:04:58.574
ken zayn az di gantse zekhtsik.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:09.918
 nu, mir hobn gelebt ale geveynlekh. mir zaynen geven, REMESLENNIKes.

00:05:09.918 --> 00:05:14.381
oyf yidish, eynike verter oyf yidish veys ikh nit vi tsu iberfirn,

00:05:14.381 --> 00:05:15.972
iz antshuldikt mir.

00:05:16.131 --> 00:05:19.249
ikh vel zogn dos oyf rusish;

00:05:19.249 --> 00:05:21.778
imetser vet dos farshteyn.

00:05:21.835 --> 00:05:24.793
REMESLENNIKes: der iz geven a shuster,

00:05:24.793 --> 00:05:28.401
der iz geven a stolyer, der iz geven a boyer,

00:05:28.401 --> 00:05:33.168
an anderer ho- flegt makhn, begodim, a shnayder.

00:05:33.394 --> 00:05:36.155
mayn tate iz geven a shmid.

00:05:36.482 --> 00:05:37.930
a shmid iz er geven.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.664
er flegt shmidn fun ayzns

00:05:40.664 --> 00:05:43.879
alts vos me darf hobn in der heym:

00:05:43.879 --> 00:05:45.875
a meser, a hak,

00:05:45.949 --> 00:05:49.229
unter-, makhn potkeves far a ferd,

00:05:49.229 --> 00:05:50.536
makhn a plug

00:05:50.536 --> 00:05:52.392
oyf akern dem feld,

00:05:52.392 --> 00:05:55.140
un azoy vayter. ale zaynen geven dan

00:05:55.281 --> 00:05:56.729
frume mentshn,

00:05:56.729 --> 00:05:58.003
zaynen geven

00:05:58.003 --> 00:06:04.575
zeyer, eyne tsu di andere flegt men zikh gut ib- gut ibergegebene.

00:06:04.575 --> 00:06:06.935
me flegt geyn keseyder in shul

00:06:07.127 --> 00:06:09.948
un me flegt gleybn in got.

00:06:09.948 --> 00:06:13.685
m'iz geven ORTODOKSAL'Ne yidn.

00:06:13.692 --> 00:06:15.761
m'iz arumgegangen mit berd,

00:06:15.902 --> 00:06:23.180
un me hot gearbet, m'iz geve- zeyer, oyf vikhtike arbetn, heyst dos, dos vos me darf yedern.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.755
fun vanet hot men gelebt?

00:06:24.829 --> 00:06:27.087
m'hot gelebt eyne fun di andere.

00:06:27.087 --> 00:06:29.784
dos iz geven a NATURAL'Ne,

00:06:30.162 --> 00:06:32.842
a NATURAL'Ne⟨r⟩ lebn.

00:06:32.842 --> 00:06:37.938
dos heyst, der makht far dem di hak, makht yener far dem, di por shikh.

00:06:37.938 --> 00:06:41.242
ot azoy hot men gelebt. der helft boyen di shtub...

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:45.701
⟨,⟩ eyne mit di andere. ot azoy hot men, gelebt

00:06:45.701 --> 00:06:49.615
bizl es iz g-, gekumen,

00:06:49.615 --> 00:06:52.087
 ken men zogn,

00:06:52.087 --> 00:06:53.932
di draysiker yorn.

00:06:54.141 --> 00:06:58.235
in di draysiker yorn, az s'iz gekumen Stalin

00:06:58.697 --> 00:07:00.868
in zayn makht in der groyser,

00:07:00.874 --> 00:07:04.682
nu, hot er shoyn ongehoybn iberarbetn undzer lebn.

00:07:04.806 --> 00:07:10.587
ershtns hot er farmakht di, di shuln, di templen.

00:07:11.168 --> 00:07:15.887
mir hobn zikh gelernt in a yidisher, shCHOOL, ikh hob zikh gelernt,

00:07:16.129 --> 00:07:20.497
iz oykhet bizl zibn, klasn,

00:07:20.736 --> 00:07:24.139
un dernokh hot er farmakht di yidishe shul oykhet.

00:07:24.195 --> 00:07:30.551
nu, un me hot gedarft f-, f- ergets geyn zikh lernen shoyn oyf, oyf rusish.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.439
di, di yidishe kultur

00:07:33.439 --> 00:07:35.630
hot er ongehoybn

00:07:35.755 --> 00:07:40.862
anulirn. ⟨der⟩ hot ongehoybn likvidirn, makhn fun deroyf oys.

00:07:42.166 --> 00:07:49.721
 iz, ot azoy, di yidn hobn shoyn nit gehat avu tsu davnen,

00:07:50.183 --> 00:07:54.193
hot men gedavnt in der heym, mayn zeyde, mayn bobe,

00:07:54.672 --> 00:08:01.823
biz vanen, bizl afile, bizl der milkhome flegn zey ondrey- onton dem tales, der, zeyde, oyf zikh,

00:08:01.823 --> 00:08:03.744
ondreyen di tfiln,

00:08:03.835 --> 00:08:09.836
un davnen un betn bay got, me zol gebn a gutn yor, un azoy vayter.

00:08:11.277 --> 00:08:15.153
nu, m'hot zikh derlebt, dervart

00:08:15.153 --> 00:08:18.361
bizl es iz dergangen,

00:08:18.361 --> 00:08:20.197
fertsik eynter yor.

00:08:19.849 --> 00:08:23.670
⟨'KAY B-⟩ ober me darf redn yetst frier fun di krig.

00:08:21.712 --> 00:08:24.956
⟨z-⟩ nokh frier far der krig?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:24.970
UNK

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:29.262
kenst zogn di nomen fun dayn bridern un shvester,

00:08:28.804 --> 00:08:32.730
m- mayne brider,

00:08:29.262 --> 00:08:31.891
un vi alt ale ⟨hobn⟩ geven?

00:08:33.837 --> 00:08:35.957
bay undz iz geven a groyse FAMILY,

00:08:37.044 --> 00:08:42.623
nor nit nor bay undz; in yene tsaytn iz geven bay ale yidn groyse FAMILIES.

00:08:43.001 --> 00:08:49.206
m'iz alemen hot gegleybt in got, ORTODOKSAL'Ne yidn. keyner flegt zikh nit aynhaltn az me zol,

00:08:49.206 --> 00:08:53.779
anulirn, dos vos darf zikh hobn, dos vos got hot gegebn.

00:08:54.088 --> 00:08:57.845
iz, nokh mir iz gegangen a shvester.

00:08:58.324 --> 00:09:02.108
 zi hot zikh gerufn, Rive,

00:09:03.015 --> 00:09:05.287
hot zikh gelernt oykhet in shCHOOL.

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:09.894
dernokh dem iz zi ongekumen in a institut zikh lernen.

00:09:11.149 --> 00:09:14.501
zi iz fun, dray un tsvantsikstn yor.

00:09:15.486 --> 00:09:19.676
nokh Riven iz geven bay mir a bruder, Hirshl.

00:09:20.076 --> 00:09:22.533
er iz fun tsvantsik finftn yor.

00:09:23.468 --> 00:09:26.685
dernokh dem iz geven a bruder bay mir, Monye.

00:09:26.995 --> 00:09:29.891
er iz oykhet fun tsvantsik zibetn yor.

00:09:30.083 --> 00:09:32.844
 gelernt z- ale hobn zikh gelernt.

00:09:33.238 --> 00:09:38.075
a shvesterl bay mir geven fun draysiktn yor, Betye.

00:09:39.212 --> 00:09:40.876
ot iz zi oyfn bild.

00:09:41.338 --> 00:09:48.301
dernokh dem iz bay mir geven der klenster Yankele. er hot zikh gehat in toyznt nayn hundert draysik akhtn yor.

00:09:50.147 --> 00:09:52.655
dos iz alts geven far der milkhome.

00:09:52.915 --> 00:09:55.491
ikh, az ikh hob geendikt zibn klasn,

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:59.287
iz lernen zikh iz shoyn bay mir nit geven avu,

00:09:59.547 --> 00:10:02.680
bin ikh avekgeforn zikh lernen

00:10:02.871 --> 00:10:04.535
in an ander shtot.

00:10:04.677 --> 00:10:06.341
ikh bin ongekumen

00:10:06.499 --> 00:10:10.087
in a shtot Zhlobin bin ikh ongekumen lernen zikh,

00:10:11.022 --> 00:10:13.849
 in, akhtn klas.

00:10:14.869 --> 00:10:16.803
bayn tog hob ikh gearbet

00:10:17.215 --> 00:10:19.419
un bay der nakht hob ikh zikh gelernt.

00:10:20.117 --> 00:10:25.612
azoy hob ikh dortn gekontshet nokh dray klasn. kh'hob gekontshet, geendikt tsen klasn.

00:10:25.939 --> 00:10:30.202
kh'hob geendikt gut. mir hobn zikh gut gelernt; mir zaynen geven feike.

00:10:32.402 --> 00:10:35.653
un, ikh hob gevolt

00:10:35.768 --> 00:10:37.830
geyn in a institut,

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:41.461
ergets lernen zikh far a inzhenyer,

00:10:41.461 --> 00:10:45.541
lernen zikh far a dokter, tsi vayter far vos.

00:10:46.273 --> 00:10:50.674
nor mir hot men a- avekgeshlept in VOENKOMAT az ikh hob geendikt.

00:10:50.674 --> 00:10:55.253
zey hobn a kuk geton mayne gute,

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:01.572
 tseykhungen vos di lerer hobn mir g- ongeshribn... ikh hob zikh gut gelernt...

00:11:01.917 --> 00:11:08.371
makht tsu mir der natshalnik, "du darfst forn lernen zikh far an artilerist."

00:11:08.886 --> 00:11:11.158
zayn a militer-layt.

00:11:12.143 --> 00:11:18.161
nit k- keyn infanterye, nor artilerye. artilerye darf men hobn matematik.

00:11:19.365 --> 00:11:23.662
un me shikt mir in a shtot Ades.

00:11:24.377 --> 00:11:27.440
dos iz oyf Ukraine. Ukraine.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:28.961
a groyse shtot.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:33.011
do iz, tsum bayshpil, zeyer a sakh yidn fun Ades.

00:11:33.085 --> 00:11:35.368
fun Ades iz geblibn a sakh yidn, vayle

00:11:35.368 --> 00:11:40.689
der daytsh iz ahin arayngegangen iber a khadoshim dray tsi fir.

00:11:41.809 --> 00:11:43.777
in milkhome-tsayt hobn zey

00:11:44.037 --> 00:11:45.786
gehat a meglekhkeyt

00:11:45.842 --> 00:11:48.435
zetsn zikh oyf shifn un m'iz avekgeforn.

00:11:49.757 --> 00:11:56.366
nor ikh bin ongekumen in der, shCHOOL bin ikh ongekumen in toyznt nayn hundert draysik nayntn yor.

00:11:58.228 --> 00:12:01.402
ikh hob zikh gelernt tsvey yor in shCHOOL.

00:12:03.595 --> 00:12:05.209
zikh gut gelernt.

00:12:06.025 --> 00:12:10.920
un, nu, vos iz faran vos tsu dertseyln vegn der shCHOOL?

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.484
kh'hob ir geendikt.

00:12:12.484 --> 00:12:15.789
frier eyder me darf hot men undz aroysgelozn,

00:12:16.048 --> 00:12:19.029
vayle vi ikh farshtey, zey hobn farshtanen

00:12:19.187 --> 00:12:21.273
az di milkhome darf zikh

00:12:21.432 --> 00:12:23.181
ot-ot onheybn.

00:12:25.313 --> 00:12:27.619
heyst dos az zey hobn gevust

00:12:27.996 --> 00:12:31.145
az di milkhome iz oyfn noz.

00:12:31.759 --> 00:12:33.744
un m'hot glaykh avekgeshikt

00:12:33.801 --> 00:12:39.549
an- undz, undzere ende, undzere, undzer grupe

00:12:40.095 --> 00:12:44.748
hot men glaykh tseshikt alemen in land.

00:12:44.748 --> 00:12:47.717
der, bay dem iz, gefint zikh zayn teyl,

00:12:47.841 --> 00:12:49.289
di militerishe,

00:12:49.289 --> 00:12:51.500
tsum bayshpil, oyf,

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.876
ergets, in Murmansk.

00:12:54.253 --> 00:12:56.038
bay dem gefint zikh,

00:12:56.038 --> 00:13:01.807
, lebn TIKHn, O- lebn shtiln okean, ahin zeyer vayt

00:13:01.932 --> 00:13:04.069
oyf, VOSTOK.

00:13:04.311 --> 00:13:10.245
bay mir iz geven oyf, ZAPAD. dos heyst, in Belarusye hot men mir opgeshikt.

00:13:11.112 --> 00:13:16.373
ikh hob geendikt di shCHOOL, mit a roytn bikhl. dos heyst,

00:13:16.373 --> 00:13:20.102
kh'hob ir geendikt,

00:13:20.102 --> 00:13:24.336
OTLICHNO, oyf rusish ⟨heyst...⟩ oyf yidish vi azoy..., oysgetseykhnt.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.537
nu, hot men mir avekgeshikt, oyf,

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:33.819
avu ikh bin geven in bu- in geburtst- mayn, in geburtst-land.

00:13:34.365 --> 00:13:38.371
mayn teyl iz geven in shtot, GOMEL'.

00:13:38.837 --> 00:13:41.733
az mir z- az ikh bin gekumen tsu forn in GOMEL',

00:13:41.925 --> 00:13:43.168
in der shtot,

00:13:44.102 --> 00:13:48.964
iz hob ikh avekgeforn. fun dortn hob ikh gemuzt avekforn

00:13:49.063 --> 00:13:50.705
in shtot Babruysk.

00:13:50.705 --> 00:13:53.225
hinter shtot Babruysk iz geven dortn o

00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:55.217
a poligon, a vald

00:13:55.408 --> 00:13:57.376
vu es iz geven

00:13:57.653 --> 00:13:58.963
mayn teyl.

00:13:59.121 --> 00:14:01.022
me hot zikh gelernt...

00:14:01.618 --> 00:14:07.766
s'iz geven zumerdike, zumerdike,...

00:14:07.766 --> 00:14:10.033
m'hot zikh gelernt, shisn.

00:14:10.765 --> 00:14:16.225
di militer hobn zikh gelernt shisn. s'iz geven in, in zumer-lagern.

00:14:16.603 --> 00:14:18.487
nu, bin ikh ahin gekumen,

00:14:19.202 --> 00:14:23.301
iz hob ikh, geven vos...

00:14:23.438 --> 00:14:25.474
m'hot mir nit opgelozn aheym,

00:14:26.222 --> 00:14:28.676
vayle epes

00:14:29.209 --> 00:14:32.543
hot men, oyf epes hot men gevart,

00:14:32.837 --> 00:14:35.159
hot men nit opgelozn aheym.

00:14:35.267 --> 00:14:39.994
mayn heym iz geven fuftsik kilometer

00:14:39.994 --> 00:14:45.454
iz zi geven fun, mayn lager, avuhin ikh bin gekumen tsu forn.

00:14:46.894 --> 00:14:50.537
hot geklibn... iz durkhgegangen a bisl tsayt.

00:14:50.961 --> 00:14:55.106
mayn mame un mayn tate, zey hobn geredt mit mir in telefon.

00:14:55.197 --> 00:14:57.385
ikh hob zikh mit zey nit gezen.

00:14:57.441 --> 00:15:01.907
az mir iz gevorn fuftsn yor bin ikh geven avekgeforn fun der heym

00:15:02.048 --> 00:15:03.696
zikh lernen vayter,

00:15:04.174 --> 00:15:08.423
hobn zey fun, fuftsn yor, fun draysik nayntn yor

00:15:08.423 --> 00:15:12.740
hobn zey mir nit gezen. dos iz shoyn geven akhtsn... nokh frier eyder fun draysik nayntn;

00:15:12.763 --> 00:15:14.242
fun draysik zibetn.

00:15:17.421 --> 00:15:20.149
mayn mame zogt tsu mir, tsum bayshpil,

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:23.990
"Moyshe, morgn kumen mir

00:15:24.272 --> 00:15:26.088
mit der gantser FAMILY,

00:15:26.095 --> 00:15:28.451
veln mir zikh zetsn oyfn parakhod"...

00:15:28.525 --> 00:15:30.251
s'iz geforn parakhod,

00:15:30.251 --> 00:15:32.450
mit azelkhe reder flegt klapn.

00:15:32.507 --> 00:15:36.331
dan, gedenk ikh, fun, Paritsh biz Babruysk iz geven

00:15:36.355 --> 00:15:38.121
di taykh BEREZINA,

00:15:38.211 --> 00:15:39.692
a groyse taykh.

00:15:39.692 --> 00:15:43.385
iz iber der taykh flegt forn der parakhod.

00:15:44.151 --> 00:15:46.963
s'iz nayntsik kilometer hot men gedarft forn.

00:15:48.707 --> 00:15:52.818
kh'veys nit vi firt men dos iber oyf eng- oyf english, kilometer,

00:15:53.027 --> 00:15:54.860
nor s'iz nit azoy vayt.

00:15:55.103 --> 00:15:56.734
morgn in der fri,

00:15:56.757 --> 00:15:59.805
tsum bayshpil, hob ikh gedarft mit zey zikh bagegenen.

00:16:02.207 --> 00:16:03.601
far deroyf

00:16:04.401 --> 00:16:09.727
hot men, far nakht undz opgelozn., s'iz geven shabes,

00:16:09.733 --> 00:16:12.815
hot men undz opgelozn, undz ofitsern,

00:16:12.957 --> 00:16:16.258
ver vil zol zikh durkhgeyn in shtot Babruysk.

00:16:17.428 --> 00:16:19.104
vorem di shtot Babruysk

00:16:19.104 --> 00:16:26.957
iz geven nit vayt fun dem lager vu mir hobn durkhgefirt undzere, UCHENIE, undzer lere

00:16:27.267 --> 00:16:29.927
oyf, shisn fun di harmatn.

00:16:30.523 --> 00:16:33.515
kh'bin gekumen in Babruysk. avuhin geyt a yunger yat?

00:16:33.515 --> 00:16:36.474
mir iz geven tsvantsik yor, bin ikh avekgegangen

00:16:36.902 --> 00:16:41.057
in, in a sod, in a park,

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:44.321
in a, ot azoy vi oto do, yener sod.

00:16:45.677 --> 00:16:53.833
nu, avu beymer vaksn. iz dortn geven a groyse tants-, tants-, ort

00:16:53.833 --> 00:16:57.854
vu yunge mentshn... geshtanen a orkester, geshpilt.

00:16:58.148 --> 00:17:01.934
dos iz geven shabes oyf der nakht.

00:17:01.934 --> 00:17:11.294
un dortn o hobn mir getantst, mir, mir hobn ale getantst, di ofitsern gekumen,... dos iz geven zeyer a groyse zakh, zayn an ofitser.

00:17:11.294 --> 00:17:13.619
s'iz ⟨b-⟩ s'iz dan geven in,

00:17:13.619 --> 00:17:19.995
 zeyer sheyn. ikh gey, bay mir do a portupey, do a rimen, do a rimen.

00:17:19.995 --> 00:17:23.353
do iz bay mir a, a shiser.

00:17:23.353 --> 00:17:27.895
dos iz geven far yunge mentshn iz dos geven gants ongenem.

00:17:27.895 --> 00:17:30.457
di meydlekh hobn holt gehat azelkhe.

00:17:30.463 --> 00:17:35.384
ikh hob zikh bag-, mit eyn meydele hob ikh zikh, bakent,

00:17:35.458 --> 00:17:38.990
a sheyne meydele, a shvartsinke, a yidishe meydele.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.527
ikh hob mit ir getantst a gantsn ovnt,

00:17:41.702 --> 00:17:43.670
 un ikh hob ir opgefirt aheym.

00:17:44.706 --> 00:17:46.804
ikh hob ir opgefirt aheym...

00:17:46.804 --> 00:17:50.454
bay hayntikn tog gedenk ikh vu iz geven ir shtub,

00:17:50.528 --> 00:17:52.915
vu iz di heym ire...

00:17:52.915 --> 00:17:57.812
un ikh hob shoyn gedarft aleyn avekgeyn, vorem ikh hob dokh gegangen mit ir aleyn.

00:17:57.852 --> 00:18:01.120
ikh hob gekumen aher mit andere khaveyrim,

00:18:01.125 --> 00:18:05.354
nor oyf kerik hob ikh shoyn zey nit gezen. zey zaynen ale tsegangen,

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:10.658
 ver mit zeyere meydlekh, un itster hob ikh shoyn gedarft geyn durkhn,

00:18:10.658 --> 00:18:14.484
durkhn taykh durkh a groysn brik, dernokh dem durkhn vald vayt,

00:18:14.608 --> 00:18:18.736
nor ikh hob gefunen avu di, di CHAST' iz.

00:18:20.599 --> 00:18:24.710
 ikh hob zikh nor avekgeleygt shlofn.

00:18:26.033 --> 00:18:27.630
es kumt mayn

00:18:28.007 --> 00:18:32.506
VESTOVOY, hot zikh gerufn, mayn ORDINARETS, oyf rusish.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.371
yeder ofitser hot gehat an ORDINARETS.

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:40.620
iz er gekumen. er hot mir gor nit gedarft oyfvekn; ikh hob zikh nit uspeyet,

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:44.741
ikh hob no- nokh nit, gehat keyn tsayt gikh oyston zikh.

00:18:45.793 --> 00:18:48.791
kumt er tsu geyn: "me ruft dir aroys in polk."

00:18:49.489 --> 00:18:51.721
"me ruft dir aroys in polk."

00:18:52.645 --> 00:18:57.847
in shtab, a⟨vu⟩ der KOMANDIR POLKA darf reydn.

00:18:57.927 --> 00:19:02.164
mir ku- geku- nu, ikh kum ahin o. ersht

00:19:02.618 --> 00:19:06.122
bay a toyznt man, der gantser polk hot zikh tsunoyfgeklibn,

00:19:06.651 --> 00:19:10.248
un der komandir, der ofitser

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.766
OB"YAVLYAET, zogt undz

00:19:14.076 --> 00:19:15.740
az di doytshn

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.115
hobn durkhgerisn

00:19:19.813 --> 00:19:21.730
undzer grenets

00:19:21.855 --> 00:19:25.578
un m'hot ongehoybn a milkhome kegn undzer land.

00:19:27.913 --> 00:19:30.812
az, frier az du geyst, ikh darf k- kumen tsurik

00:19:30.812 --> 00:19:35.107
fun, frier fun di krig, vi azoy di lebn hot geven

00:19:31.186 --> 00:19:32.434
DA.

00:19:35.107 --> 00:19:39.011
in PARICHI, in Belarus, vi azoy du host gelebt

00:19:39.169 --> 00:19:43.241
frier fun di milkhome. vos hostu getun mit dayn,

00:19:43.241 --> 00:19:48.427
mit dayn shvester, mit dayn bruder? vos hot ⟨di g-⟩ lebn geven in P-...?

00:19:45.278 --> 00:19:46.065
o.

00:19:46.915 --> 00:19:52.911
der, der lebn iz geven bay undz, vi me zogt dos,

00:19:52.911 --> 00:19:55.511
a eynfakher, a eynfakher lebn.

00:19:55.511 --> 00:20:01.454
mir hobn gelebt, in der shtetl. zi iz geven vayt fun shtet.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.470
tsum bayshpil, d- zen a ban,

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:07.246
a ban... veyst vos s'iz a ban?

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:13.997
nu, a PAROVOZ, a ban, a, an aeroplan,

00:20:14.438 --> 00:20:20.135
hob ikh dos derzen az ikh bin shoyn geven, alt fertsn yor.

00:20:20.513 --> 00:20:22.785
bizl deroyf hob ikh nit gezen.

00:20:22.825 --> 00:20:24.759
es fleg durkhforn eyn

00:20:25.947 --> 00:20:29.540
CAR, eyn AVTOMOBIL' fleg durkhforn,

00:20:29.743 --> 00:20:31.525
flegn mir yinglekh,

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:34.735
kinder, loyfn kukn: vos iz dos far a,

00:20:34.735 --> 00:20:39.958
far a khaye, vos iz dos? mir hobn dos UNK in a shtetl hobn mir dos, dan...

00:20:39.958 --> 00:20:44.025
in Rusland iz bay hayntikn tog efsher oykhet nit a- nito azoy fil o,

00:20:44.025 --> 00:20:47.982
vi s'iz do in, in Amerike, nor dan,

00:20:47.982 --> 00:20:52.519
dos iz geven nor bay eynem: bay dem balebos fun gants⟨n⟩ rayon.

00:20:52.643 --> 00:20:54.088
hot men im gegebn

00:20:54.111 --> 00:20:58.697
a mashinke, iz flegn mir loyfn kukn beys er fort.

00:20:58.697 --> 00:21:04.246
azoy iz dos geven, azoy zaynen mir geven, eynfakh.

00:21:04.472 --> 00:21:07.447
nor vos? yederer fun undz hot gearbet.

00:21:07.447 --> 00:21:09.410
s'iz geven shver tsu lebn,

00:21:09.518 --> 00:21:14.395
iz mir kinder, az flegn kumen fun shul, fun shkole,

00:21:14.445 --> 00:21:18.332
flegn mir arbetn. ikh fleg geyn tsum tatn in kuznye

00:21:18.332 --> 00:21:20.177
un ikh fleg im helfn,

00:21:20.233 --> 00:21:24.226
 m- makhn, di,

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.196
 dem instrument velkhn er darf.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.651
ershtns iz

00:21:28.651 --> 00:21:36.305
geven aza min, lange, ⟨⟩, palke vos m'hot gedarft di gantse tsayt blozn,

00:21:36.305 --> 00:21:39.282
s'zol geyn VOZDUKH, s'zol geyn, luft,

00:21:39.282 --> 00:21:42.097
zol geyn ahin o in,

00:21:42.171 --> 00:21:46.940
avu der fayer brent un es ligt der ayzn. der ayzn darf vern shtark royt,

00:21:47.014 --> 00:21:49.522
darf men hipsh arbetn oyf im.

00:21:50.102 --> 00:21:53.617
farshteyst? dernokh dem fleg ikh dem tatn mit a hamer...

00:21:53.617 --> 00:21:57.389
a kleyn yatl, nor vifl, s'fleg zayn nit keyn groyser hamer...

00:21:57.389 --> 00:22:01.453
fleg ikh helfn klapn un makhn di hak, tsum bayshpil.

00:22:01.746 --> 00:22:05.042
in der heym iz bay undz geven, tsvey beheymes.

00:22:05.042 --> 00:22:07.160
es iz geven a groyser hoyf

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:08.434
un a sod,

00:22:08.434 --> 00:22:11.713
hot men dos gedarft baarbetn. ikh bin geven der elterer,

00:22:11.955 --> 00:22:15.273
fleg ikh dos alts darfn helfn der mamen.

00:22:16.393 --> 00:22:18.854
mayn mame hot oykh gearbet.

00:22:18.854 --> 00:22:22.955
zi iz geven in a kinder-gortn iz zi geven a lererin.

00:22:22.955 --> 00:22:26.186
kleyne kinderlekh hot men gedarft,

00:22:26.186 --> 00:22:29.904
mit zey arbetn, a kinder tsvantsik, draysik.

00:22:30.113 --> 00:22:36.351
ot. di klenere kinder hot zi oykhet genumen tsu zikh in kinder-gortn. flegn untervaksn,

00:22:36.812 --> 00:22:39.911
flegn zey geyn in shCHOOL. m'hot zikh gelernt

00:22:40.255 --> 00:22:42.173
un me flegt arbetn.

00:22:42.364 --> 00:22:46.931
mir hobn nit gevust fun, vos s'heyst nit arbetn.

00:22:47.494 --> 00:22:49.631
un mir zaynen take geven shtarke.

00:22:49.941 --> 00:22:51.861
ot flist di taykh:

00:22:51.861 --> 00:22:56.589
vi nor a fraye minut, flegn mir loyfn in taykh

00:22:56.589 --> 00:22:59.198
zikh bodn, mir flegn loyfn shvimen,

00:22:59.198 --> 00:23:02.012
mir flegn forn oyf a lotke, mir flegn mit U-

00:23:02.012 --> 00:23:05.831
UDOCHKes, mit, kha- farvarfn un khapn fish.

00:23:05.888 --> 00:23:09.611
dos iz geven undzer lebn, undzer... mir flegn geyn borvese.

00:23:10.174 --> 00:23:13.425
mir flegn geyn in vald, flegn mir geyn klaybn shvoymen,

00:23:14.022 --> 00:23:15.973
klaybn yagedes.

00:23:16.013 --> 00:23:18.487
mir flegn geyn zumer nor borvese.

00:23:19.506 --> 00:23:21.744
ot azoy hobn mir dan gelebt,

00:23:22.206 --> 00:23:27.192
vi in a shtetl, in Sholem-Aleykhem's shtetlekh. farshteyt?

00:23:27.825 --> 00:23:30.755
nu, azoy iz dos geven.

00:23:31.673 --> 00:23:35.410
vos, geven eynfakh, gor eynfakh.

00:23:35.503 --> 00:23:40.469
di mumes zaynen geven bay mir. eyne tsu di andere, m'hot, gehat

00:23:40.469 --> 00:23:42.922
eyne tsu di andere a libshaft,

00:23:43.958 --> 00:23:47.328
a got-libshaft, nit vos

00:23:47.328 --> 00:23:49.886
itster o, ikh kuk oyf eynike, iz

00:23:49.886 --> 00:23:52.896
fargest men afile oyf a f- a feter, oyf a bruder.

00:23:53.307 --> 00:23:58.633
nor, dan iz men geven mer, vayle m'hot gegleybt in got.

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:00.388
ir farshteyt?

00:24:00.816 --> 00:24:05.080
dernokh dem hot g- fun undz got tsugenumen Stalin.

00:24:05.642 --> 00:24:07.441
er hot ir tsugenumen.

00:24:08.207 --> 00:24:11.572
er hot farmakht di shuln: oys shuln.

00:24:12.612 --> 00:24:14.496
mir hobn gemeynt az,

00:24:15.261 --> 00:24:20.765
mir yungvarg hobn gemeynt az ⟨a-⟩ mir veln ale zayn glaykh,

00:24:20.931 --> 00:24:24.789
nor mir hobn nit gefilt dem antisemitizm dortn in shtetl.

00:24:25.352 --> 00:24:27.573
s'iz geven lebn undz poyerim...

00:24:28.305 --> 00:24:29.750
veyst vos s'iz poyerim?

00:24:30.043 --> 00:24:34.255
zey zaynen geven gelebt lebn undz. zey hobn gelebt fun di yidn.

00:24:35.595 --> 00:24:42.976
tsum bayshpil, er fleg kumen, az me flegt, peysekh,

00:24:42.976 --> 00:24:46.628
me pravet dem peysekh, hobn zey gevust az zey darfn kumen,

00:24:46.628 --> 00:24:48.279
der shokhn, tsu undz

00:24:48.302 --> 00:24:51.164
un oystrinken altsenesding vos me gist op.

00:24:52.403 --> 00:24:57.435
farshteyt? dos, yents, mir flegn koyfn bay zey fish.

00:24:57.820 --> 00:25:04.928
mir flegn koyfn bay zey epes avos, holts ⟨tsu⟩ an andersh mol. nor,

00:25:05.295 --> 00:25:08.170
mir hobn gelebt oykhet, mir flegn aleyn oykhet

00:25:08.170 --> 00:25:11.532
forn in vald mit dem tatn, mir flegn,

00:25:11.607 --> 00:25:17.389
 onhakn holts, flegn nemen a ferd, a ba- balegole,

00:25:17.631 --> 00:25:21.720
un brengen dos ⟨a-⟩ tsu firn oyf vinter; s'iz geven bay undz kalt.

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:26.487
es iz geven, flegt dergeyn draysik, minus draysik, nokh,

00:25:26.487 --> 00:25:31.414
nit PO FARENGEYTU, PO TSEL'SIYU draysik grad.

00:25:31.414 --> 00:25:37.656
darf men dos, in deroyf, s'zol zayn in shtub varem. bay undz iz geven hiltserne hayzer.

00:25:38.134 --> 00:25:41.941
bay undz iz geven a groyse FAMILY, iz geven bay undz,

00:25:42.032 --> 00:25:46.357
 fir, groyse BEDROOMes.

00:25:46.707 --> 00:25:53.441
⟨ot⟩. geven tsvey shtaln oyfn hoyf mit tsvey beheymes, gen- gendz, hiner.

00:25:53.441 --> 00:25:59.778
ot azoy hobn mir gelebt. mir hobn gelebt, aleyn fun der eygener, balebatishkeyt,

00:26:00.190 --> 00:26:03.584
nit vos geyst arayn in krom un du koyfst.

00:26:03.584 --> 00:26:08.101
kenst geyn oyfn mark, flegt der brengen dos farkoyfn,

00:26:08.101 --> 00:26:10.665
yener brengt zayn arbet farkoyfn,

00:26:10.665 --> 00:26:13.894
UNK poyerim fun dorf brengen bulbes farkoyfn,

00:26:13.894 --> 00:26:18.358
der brengt hey farkoyfn. azoy iz geven di merk.

00:26:18.516 --> 00:26:21.919
dos iz geven ot, bizl der milkhome

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:24.703
bay undz in shtetele Paritsh.

00:26:24.895 --> 00:26:28.620
nu, un ikh hob avekgeforn, hob zikh gelernt,

00:26:28.725 --> 00:26:30.170
un ikh hob gearbet.

00:26:30.254 --> 00:26:31.504
UNK

00:26:30.312 --> 00:26:35.419
host gehat andere mentshn UNK gelebt in dayn hoyz mit dayn mishpokhe?

00:26:34.918 --> 00:26:39.535
neyn. ⟨,⟩ dos iz geven a zelb- a zelbst-shtub.

00:26:39.576 --> 00:26:43.282
oyfgeboyt a zelbst-shtub. s'iz dokh geven yidn boyer.

00:26:44.487 --> 00:26:47.771
tsum bayshpil, mayn tate hot opgetsolt,

00:26:47.963 --> 00:26:53.779
hobn zey oyfgeboyt di shtub. dos iz nokh, ikh gedenk nit ven zey hobn dos oyfgeboyt, vorem,

00:26:53.785 --> 00:26:59.094
 er hot gedarft khasene hobn, hot er dan dos gemakht. dernokh dem hot er genumen der mamen.

00:26:59.539 --> 00:27:01.170
azoy iz dos geven.

00:27:02.813 --> 00:27:07.329
fun yene yorn dertseyln a sakh iz bay mir nito vos,

00:27:07.470 --> 00:27:14.672
vorem ikh hob a sakh fargesn ⟨d-⟩, di penemer af- afile fun eynike. s'iz durkhgegangen azoy fil yorn.

00:27:14.672 --> 00:27:17.403
got mayner, shoyn arum zekhtsik yor

00:27:17.663 --> 00:27:20.374
UNK durkhgegangen, nor vos ikh gedenk,

00:27:20.734 --> 00:27:22.213
vos ikh gedenk,

00:27:22.708 --> 00:27:27.376
ot⟨, iz⟩ shteyt for bay hayntikn tog antkegn mayne oygn.

00:27:27.585 --> 00:27:33.266
vos hot geven dayn tsil in lebn AS a yunge-man? vos hot ge- dayn, dayn...

00:27:33.357 --> 00:27:35.665
STREMLENIE, vos hob ikh gevolt zayn?

00:27:34.144 --> 00:27:35.764
tsu tun? yo.

00:27:35.665 --> 00:27:37.248
vos hob ikh gevolt zayn?

00:27:36.577 --> 00:27:37.577
yo.

00:27:37.423 --> 00:27:40.302
ikh hob gevolt vern a inzhenyer,

00:27:40.545 --> 00:27:43.703
tsum bayshpil. ot. nu,

00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:48.976
ikh hob dos nit gekent dergreykhn, vayle mir hot VOENKOMAT, VOENNe,

00:27:49.033 --> 00:27:51.646
VOENNe, vo- vos mobilizirt...

00:27:51.683 --> 00:27:56.196
 do iz oykhet faran VOENKOMATn, nor ikh veys nit vi zey rufn zikh onet.

00:27:56.196 --> 00:27:58.759
in Rusland, oyf rusish ruft zikh VOENKOMAT...

00:27:58.759 --> 00:28:01.889
vos nemt di yunge mentshn

00:28:02.010 --> 00:28:03.877
un shikt in der armey.

00:28:05.672 --> 00:28:08.315
zey hobn mir opgeshikt in der armey.

00:28:09.891 --> 00:28:10.847
farshteyt?

00:28:10.566 --> 00:28:11.215
yo.

00:28:11.055 --> 00:28:13.481
ot. nu, bin ikh gevorn,

00:28:13.481 --> 00:28:15.959
ikh bin take tsufridn vos ikh bin gevorn

00:28:16.624 --> 00:28:19.115
a militer-man.

00:28:19.257 --> 00:28:21.208
ikh bin tsufridn deroyf,

00:28:21.417 --> 00:28:24.364
vos, az s'hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome,

00:28:24.943 --> 00:28:29.033
hob ikh gekent mayn teyl

00:28:29.033 --> 00:28:31.504
vos ikh hob gekent arayntrogn

00:28:31.504 --> 00:28:33.493
in shlogn dem Natsi,

00:28:34.798 --> 00:28:37.461
bin ikh zeyer fun deroyf tsufridn.
